@model GuidePageViewModel
@* QE@@Home: flourish section. Edit content here; layout, navigation and footer are in Views/Shared/_QEatHomeLayout.cshtml. *@
  <div class="hero"><div class="hero-img" style="background-image:url(/qe-at-home/img/sport.jpg);background-position:60% 55%"></div>
    <div class="in"><div class="kicker">3:30pm to 4:15pm, Monday to Thursday</div><h1>QE Flourish During Distance Learning</h1></div>
  </div>
  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="narrow center"><p class="lead">QE Flourish helps children stay connected, explore their interests and enjoy school life during distance learning. Every club runs from 3:30pm to 4:15pm, with practical activity and time away from the screen, and no more than 25 children per meeting.</p></div>
      <div class="days"><div><small>Monday</small><b>Challenge</b></div><div><small>Tuesday</small><b>Create</b></div><div><small>Wednesday</small><b>Care</b></div><div><small>Thursday</small><b>Compete</b></div></div>
      <p class="center">Participation is optional. Friday is family time, away from screens.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="block alt">
    <div class="wrap grid2">
      <div>
        <h2>Choosing Clubs</h2>
        <div class="tbl"><table style="min-width:0">
          <tr><th>Year group</th><th>Weekly offer</th></tr>
          <tr><td class="k">Nursery and FS</td><td>Flourish continues on the normal designated days</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="k">Years 1 to 3</td><td>One or two clubs a week. Week A: Monday and Wednesday. Week B: Tuesday and Thursday</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="k">Years 4 to 8</td><td>Up to one club each day, Monday to Thursday</td></tr>
        </table></div>
        <p>School squads continue each week, with safe coaching and activities for home; existing squad eligibility applies. Squad, choir and instrumental sessions count as your child’s club for that day, and within the Years 1 to 3 limit of two sessions a week.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Booking Once for the Week</h2>
        <div class="callout">There is no Flourish on the first day of distance learning. Families book that morning, while staff prepare groups and registers.</div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li><strong>Book in the morning.</strong> Between 8:00am and 11:00am on the first morning, complete one Microsoft Form per child, shared on Seesaw and Firefly, choosing the whole week’s clubs.</li>
          <li><strong>Wait for confirmation.</strong> We check year groups, limits and spaces, then send confirmed places and meeting invitations. Submitting the Form requests a place; it does not confirm one.</li>
          <li><strong>Join at 3:30pm</strong> on club days, using your child’s school account and the confirmed meeting.</li>
        </ol>
        <p>There is no daily rebooking. If a choice is full, we will offer another suitable club, and children who missed a choice get priority next time. Each sibling needs a separate response. If plans change, contact the phase lead rather than submitting a second Form.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap grid2">
      <div>
        <h2>What Happens in a Session</h2>
        <div class="tbl"><table style="min-width:0">
          <tr><th>Time</th><th>Activity</th></tr>
          <tr><td>3:30pm to 3:35pm</td><td>Welcome and register</td></tr>
          <tr><td>3:35pm to 3:50pm</td><td>A short explanation and guided activity</td></tr>
          <tr><td>3:50pm to 4:10pm</td><td>A practical task, with time away from the screen</td></tr>
          <tr><td>4:10pm to 4:15pm</td><td>Share and finish; the teacher closes the call</td></tr>
        </table></div>
        <p>For Years 1 to 3, the teacher may end the live call slightly earlier and set an offline activity after 4pm. No child needs to watch the screen continuously.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Simple, Safe Activities</h2>
        <p>Puzzles, stories, art, performance, Arabic language activities, kindness projects and friendly challenges, using ordinary materials. No new purchase or personal online account is needed.</p>
        <p>There is no live swimming, cooking with heat, hazardous experiment or unsupervised outdoor activity. Please keep an adult nearby for younger children. Routine Flourish support ends at 4:15pm.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
